· Native Language Understanding: Built natively to understand subtle nuances, spatial relationships, and detailed context within user prompts without requiring complex "prompt engineering."

· In-Image Text Rendering: Capable of generating clear, legible text embedded directly within images (e.g., signs, labels, logos).

