Data is the raw material used by AI systems. It may include text, images, audio, video, numbers, transactions, sensor readings or medical records. AI systems learn patterns from data. The quality, relevance and fairness of the data are crucial. Bad data can lead to bad AI, no matter how advanced the model appears.

