A deepfake is AI-generated or AI-manipulated media that makes someone appear to say or do something they did not say or do. Deepfakes can be used for entertainment, but also for fraud, harassment, misinformation and political manipulation. As deepfakes become more realistic, media literacy and verification become increasingly important.

